doc:letterJpcl a schema:ScholarlyArticle ;
    rdfs:label "The formation of cesium lead bromide (CsPbBr 3 ) nanocrystal superlattices (NC SLs) is accompanied by a red shift in the NC photoluminescence (PL)"@en ;
